        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "するどい　まえばで　けずりとった\nきのえだや　ねっこを　つみあげて\nみずべに　せっせと　すを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "예리한 앞니로 갉아 얻은\n나뭇가지나 뿌리를 쌓아\n물가에 부지런히 보금자리를 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il tranche les branches et les racines de ses incisives\naiguisées pour construire des barrages.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Emsig durchbeißt es mit seinen scharfen Vorderzähnen\nWurzeln und Äste und baut daraus sein Nest.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con sus incisivos roe ramas y raíces y las apila para\nconstruir sus madrigueras junto al río.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Costruisce con zelo la tana in riva ai corsi d’acqua,\nlevigando radici e rami con gli affilati incisivi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It busily makes its nest with stacks of branches and\nroots it has cut up with its sharp incisors.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鋭い　前歯で　削り取った\n木の枝や　根っこを　積み上げて\n水辺に　せっせと　巣を　作る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con sus incisivos roe ramas y raíces y las apila para\nconstruir sus madrigueras junto al río.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かわを　きのみきや　どろの　ダムで\nせきとめて　すみかを　つくる。\nはたらきものとして　しられている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "강을 나무줄기나 진흙의 댐으로\n막아서 거처를 만든다.\n부지런한 일꾼으로 알려져 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il construit des barrages de boue et d’écorce le long\ndes fleuves. C’est un ouvrier de renom.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es baut sein Nest, indem es in Flüssen Dämme aus\nSchlamm und Ästen baut. Ein fleißiger Arbeiter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para anidar, crea presas en los ríos con maderas y\nbarro. Tiene fama de trabajador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sbarra il corso dei fiumi con corteccia e fango per\nfarsi la tana. È noto come lavoratore instancabile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It makes its nest by damming streams with bark and\nmud. It is known as an industrious worker.",
